,41]],"en":"Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower?"},{"n":65,"ar":"لَوْ نَشَآءُ لَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ حُطَـٰمًا فَظَلْتُمْ تَفَكَّهُونَ","tg":[[7,11,6],[22,26,3],[31,35,3],[35,41,9],[57,60,4]],"tr":"Law nashao lajaAAalnahu hutaman fathaltum tafakkahoona","tu":[[20,21],[24,25],[26,28],[29,30],[34,36],[50,52]],"en":"If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder,"},{"n":66,"ar":"إِنَّا لَمُغْرَمُونَ","tg":[[2,5,14],[15,18,4]],"tr":"Inna lamughramoona","tu":[[3,4],[14,16]],"en":"[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt;"},{"n":67,"ar":"بَلْ نَحْنُ مَحْرُومُونَ","tg":[[19,22,4]],"tr":"Bal nahnu mahroomoona","tu":[[6,7],[12,13],[14,16],[17,19]],"en":"Rather, we have been deprived.\""},{"n":68,"ar":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ ٱلْمَآءَ ٱلَّذِى تَشْرَبُونَ","tg":[[15,16,0],[18,22,6],[25,26,0],[39,42,4]],"tr":"Afaraaytumu almaa allathee tashraboona","tu":[[15,16],[22,26],[34,36]],"en":"And have you seen the water that you drink?"},{"n":69,"ar":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَنزَلْتُمُوهُ مِنَ ٱلْمُزْنِ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْمُنزِلُونَ","tg":[[4,7,9],[12,15,9],[30,31,0],[52,53,0],[57,60,9],[60,63,4]],"tr":"Aantum anzaltumoohu mina almuzni am nahnu almunziloona","tu":[[15,17],[38,39],[50,52]],"en":"Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down?"},{"n":70,"ar":"لَوْ نَشَآءُ جَعَلْنَـٰهُ أُجَاجًا فَلَوْلَا تَشْكُرُونَ","tg":[[7,11,6],[20,24,3],[32,38,9],[52,55,4]],"tr":"Law nashao jaAAalnahu ojajan falawla tashkuroona","tu":[[18,19],[35,36],[44,46]],"en":"If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful?"},{"n":71,"ar":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ ٱلنَّارَ ٱلَّتِى تُورُونَ","tg":[[15,16,0],[16,17,2],[17,20,14],[24,25,0],[35,38,4]],"tr":"Afaraaytumu alnnara allatee tooroona","tu":[[16,17],[25,27],[29,31],[32,34]],"en":"And have you seen the fire that you ignite?"},{"n":72,"ar":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَنشَأْتُمْ شَجَرَتَهَآ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْمُنشِـُٔونَ","tg":[[4,7,9],[12,15,9],[30,34,6],[47,48,0],[52,58,9]],"tr":"Aantum anshatum shajarataha am nahnu almunshioona","tu":[[26,27],[33,34],[45,47]],"en":"Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer?"},{"n":73,"ar":"نَحْنُ جَعَلْنَـٰهَا تَذْكِرَةً وَمَتَـٰعًا لِّلْمُقْوِينَ","tg":[[13,17,3],[29,34,12],[36,40,3],[40,47,13],[51,53,7],[53,56,4]],"tr":"Nahnu jaAAalnaha tathkiratan wamataAAan lilmuqweena","tu":[[2,3],[13,14],[15,16],[19,21],[34,35],[37,38],[47,49]],"en":"We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers,"},{"n":74,"ar":"فَسَبِّحْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","tg":[[12,13,0],[26,27,0],[31,34,4]],"tr":"Fasabbih biismi rabbika alAAatheemi","tu":[[7,8],[29,33]],"en":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great."},{"n":75,"ar":"۞ فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِمَوَٰقِعِ ٱلنُّجُومِ","tg":[[4,8,6],[11,13,7],[22,25,3],[30,31,0],[31,32,2],[32,35,14],[35,38,4]],"tr":"Fala oqsimu bimawaqiAAi alnnujoomi","tu":[[3,4],[17,18],[30,32]],"en":"Then I swear by the setting of the stars,"},{"n":76,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَقَسَمٌ لَّوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عَظِيمٌ","tg":[[4,7,14],[7,10,3],[17,23,13],[40,43,4]],"tr":"Wainnahu laqasamun law taAAlamoona AAatheemun","tu":[[30,32],[38,42]],"en":"And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great."},{"n":77,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقُرْءَانٌ كَرِيمٌ","tg":[[2,5,14],[5,8,3],[18,23,9],[23,26,4]],"tr":"Innahu laquranun kareemun","tu":[[12,13],[20,22]],"en":"Indeed, it is a noble Qur’ān."},{"n":78,"ar":"فِى كِتَـٰبٍ مَّكْنُونٍ","tg":[[6,10,3],[10,16,12],[18,21,4]],"tr":"Fee kitabin maknoonin","tu":[[1,3],[7,8],[16,18]],"en":"In a Register well-protected;."},{"n":79,"ar":"لَّا يَمَسُّهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلْمُطَهَّرُونَ","tg":[[12,16,6],[24,25,0],[34,37,4]],"tr":"La yamassuhu illa almutahharoona","tu":[[1,2],[16,17],[22,23],[28,30]],"en":"None touch it except the purified [i.e., the angels]."},{"n":80,"ar":"تَنزِيلٌ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","tg":[[2,5,9],[6,12,12],[21,22,0],[24,28,3],[30,33,4]],"tr":"Tanzeelun min rabbi alAAalameena","tu":[[4,6],[24,25],[28,30]],"en":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds."},{"n":81,"ar":"أَفَبِهَـٰذَا ٱلْحَدِي